-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

The user guide (docs/guide) uses Righteous, Nunito and JetBrains Mono, under the SIL Open Font License 1.1:
copyright lines and the full licence in docs/guide/fonts/OFL.txt. The PDF also embeds small subsets of
